### QuickBasket API - end-to-end test (VS Code "REST Client" extension, Visual Studio, or Rider).
### Run the requests top to bottom. Development settings use the MOCK payment provider.
### Sample accounts come from appsettings.Development.json.

@host = https://localhost:7080

### 1. Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Admin login (seeded)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@quickbasket.local", "password": "DevAdmin#12345" }

### 3. Register a customer
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "priya@example.com", "password": "Customer#12345", "fullName": "Priya S.", "phoneNumber": "9000000000" }

### 3b. Or log in if already registered
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "priya@example.com", "password": "Customer#12345" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Browse (no token needed)
# @name products
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=milk

@productId = {{products.response.body.items[0].id}}

### 5. Add to cart
POST {{host}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 3 }

### 6. Save an address
# @name address
POST {{host}}/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "Home", "recipientName": "Priya S.", "phone": "9000000000", "line1": "Flat 4B, Lakeview Residency",
  "city": "Bengaluru", "state": "Karnataka", "postalCode": "560034", "isDefault": true }

### 7. Checkout: creates the order with a server-calculated total
# @name order
POST {{host}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "addressId": "{{address.response.body.id}}", "notes": "Ring the bell" }

@orderId = {{order.response.body.id}}

### 8. Start payment. confirmedByCustomer MUST be true. Method: Upi | UpiQr | Card | NetBanking | CashOnDelivery
# @name payment
POST {{host}}/api/payments/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: test-key-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "method": "UpiQr", "confirmedByCustomer": true }

@paymentId = {{payment.response.body.paymentId}}

### 8b. Without confirmation it must be rejected (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/payments/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "method": "Card", "confirmedByCustomer": false }

### 9. Same Idempotency-Key again returns the SAME payment (no second charge attempt)
POST {{host}}/api/payments/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: test-key-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "method": "UpiQr", "confirmedByCustomer": true }

### 10. Status is still pending: the API never trusts the browser
GET {{host}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. DEV ONLY: play the gateway and pay (sends a signed webhook). Use success=false to test failure.
POST {{host}}/api/dev/mock-payments/{{paymentId}}/simulate?success=true

### 11b. Replaying the same kind of event is harmless (still captured once)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/mock-payments/{{paymentId}}/simulate?success=true

### 12. Payment is now Captured and the order Confirmed
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. A customer token must NOT reach admin endpoints (expect 403)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Admin: orders and payments
GET {{host}}/api/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Admin: refund half (Idempotency-Key required)
# @name refund
POST {{host}}/api/admin/payments/{{paymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: refund-key-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50, "reason": "Damaged item" }

### 16. DEV ONLY: gateway finishes the refund, payment becomes PartiallyRefunded
POST {{host}}/api/dev/mock-payments/refunds/{{refund.response.body.id}}/process

### 17. Admin: advance the order (status values: Packed, OutForDelivery, Delivered)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Packed", "note": "Packed at store" }
